This package is the open, auditable part of Staffkey: it transforms a user's private rows into
poolable, anonymized points and enforces the k-anonymity floor and per-contributor caps. It has
no dependencies and performs no network or database I/O, so it can be read in full to verify
what data is eligible to leave the user's private store. The Staffkey dataset, aggregation
service, and benchmark are NOT covered by this license and remain proprietary.
